OL,3,GNEWSAEx-GTA developer's studio faces
OL,4,Aclosure after debut game flopped
OL,5,
OL,6,FA video game studio founded by a former
OL,7,Fsenior Grand Theft Auto developer is
OL,8,Ffacing closure 15 months after the
OL,9,Fdisastrous release of its debut game.
OL,11,FEdinburgh-based Build A Rocket Boy
OL,12,F(Barb) launched MindsEye in June 2025
OL,13,Fto a string of bad reviews and player
OL,14,Fcomplaints, with some calling it "the
OL,15,Fworst game" of the year.
OL,17,FFormer workers said development of the
OL,18,Fgame was chaotic and accused its boss,
OL,19,FLeslie Benzies, of mismanaging the
OL,20,Fstudio.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
